WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You hear a syllable. You watch the lips. They seem to agree.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But what if the audio and the face came from two different recordings?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In the McGurk experiment, some listeners report a third sound.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Your report can be sincere. It can still differ from the original track.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That is a perception finding—not proof of a meditation product.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check the evidence. Compare formats. Decide whether you need to buy anything.
